function CTA({text,onClick,disabled=false,secondary=false}){return <Button context={context} text={text} allowLabelCase type={secondary?'text':'contained'} colorType="primary" fullWidth disabled={disabled} onClick={onClick} style={{fontFamily:'inherit',fontSize:13,fontWeight:600,padding:'14px 18px',borderRadius:12,minHeight:48,boxShadow:'none'}}/>;}
const gameProducts=['latte','cheesecake','croissant','lemonade','americano','cappuccino','turkish','iced','tea','herbal','brownie','toast'];
const deck=number=>game.createDeck(number,gameProducts);
const orderDate=value=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat('tr-TR',{timeZone:'Europe/Istanbul',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}).format(new Date(value));
